 "title": "Working with Procurement Workspace Projects",
 "body": "<!DOCTYPE html\n  SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\" dir=\"ltr\"><head><title>Working with Procurement Workspace Projects</title><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"abstract\" content=\"Your organization might use procurement workspace projects, which can help you meet compliance or financial goals. They allow you to group procurement activities so they can be managed together.\"><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Your organization might use procurement workspace projects, which can help you meet compliance or financial goals. They allow you to group procurement activities so they can be managed together.\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"screen,projection\" href=\"/resource/css/style-v2.css\"><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"js/sap-strings.js\"></script></head><body class=\"en-us sap-light centered navigation-default enumeration-disabled collapsify-enabled\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-container\" class=\"container_12\" role=\"application\"><div id=\"d4h5-section-container\" class=\"grid_12\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-content\" class=\"grid_8 alpha omega\"><section><div class=\"page concept  - topic-topic concept-concept \" id=\"loio49acfe1e32874cff87a8af28f88ffd45\"><h1 class=\"title topictitle1\">Working with Procurement Workspace Projects</h1><div class=\"body conbody\"><p class=\"shortdesc\">Your organization might use procurement workspace projects, which can help you meet\ncompliance or financial goals. They allow you to group procurement activities so they can be\nmanaged together. </p>\n<p class=\"p\"></p>\n</div><div class=\"related-links\"> <br><ul class=\"ullinks\"><div><strong><a class=\"link\" href=\"31e7d81d212c4bb69e0a010dfc55cab4.html\" title=\"Your organization might allow you to create procurement workspace projects, which can help you meet compliance or financial goals. To create a project, you fill out and submit a project form, which might ask questions about your goals.\">Creating a Project</a></strong><br></div><div><strong><a class=\"link\" href=\"e212f2d05fdc44389e6cf1ac3dcb7478.html\" title=\"If your organization uses procurement workspace projects, add your request or invoice to a project before submitting it so that your organization can track it.\">Adding a Request or Invoice to a Project</a></strong><br></div><div><strong><a class=\"link\" href=\"e6f53acc45454798b728a635d8615d2c.html\" title=\"The Projects tab in the Your requests page lists all of your procurement workspace projects and their statuses. You can click to view a project summary and details.\">Viewing Project Details</a></strong><br></div></ul></div></div></section><div class=\"clear\"></div>\n</div></div></div></body></html>"
